  "description": "The PIXL 8000 Prefilled Pod Vape Kit delivers a powerful and practical closed-pod vaping system, designed for users who want extended performance without compromising simplicity. Featuring a 650mAh rechargeable battery and an innovative top-mounted TFT display, the PIXL 8000 offers clear visibility of both battery level and remaining e-liquid at a glance. Each kit supports up to 8000 puffs via a unique combination of a 2ml prefilled pod and an integrated 10ml refill chamber housed inside the device. This compact device is designed for mouth-to-lung (MTL) vaping and produces discreet vapour while delivering fast-acting nicotine satisfaction, thanks to the smooth 20mg Nic Salt formulation in each pod. It uses mesh coil technology to ensure consistent vapour production and full flavour across the pod’s lifespan, with an optional Boost Mode to increase vapour intensity with a quick double-click of the power button. The PIXL 8000’s magnetic pod fitting, child-lock function, and USB-C fast charging ensure a reliable and secure user experience. With no manual e-liquid refilling, no coil changes, and a wide selection of PIXL 8000 refill pod flavours, this kit provides a practical solution for everyday vapers seeking longevity and ease of use in one device. PIXL 8000 Kit Flavours Black Cherry A rich, juicy Cherry flavour with a darker fruit edge Blue Cherry Cranberry A tangy mix of Blueberry, Cherry and sharp Cranberry Blue Magic Sweet Blueberry, aniseed twist, cool Menthol finish Blue Razz Cherry A sweet-and-sour medley of Blue Raspberry and Cherry Blue Razz Chew Chewy Blue Raspberry with a confectionery-style twist Blue Razz Lemonade Sweet Blue Raspberry with a zesty Lemonade backdrop Blueberry Raspberry A bright, juicy blend of two summer berries Blueberry Sour Razz Rich Blueberry with a tangy Raspberry sour note Cherry Ice Bright Cherry flavour finished with a streak of Menthol Cherry Pop Sweet Cherry, creamy Vanilla and a touch of Almond Cola Lime Classic Cola with a squeeze of sharp Lime Double Apple Red and green Apple flavours with a crisp, clean finish Fresh Mint A bright and clean Mint flavour Hawaiian Oasis Mango, Pineapple, Passionfruit and a streak of Menthol Juicy Peach Soft, ripe Peach with mellow sweetness Lemon and Lime Bright citrus pairing of zesty Lemon and Lime Mango Ice Sweet Mango with a cool Menthol finish Paradise Punch A tropical fruit medley with vibrant, juicy notes Pineapple Ice Bold Pineapple with a brisk, cooling lift Pink Lemonade Sweet mixed berries with a sharp citrus sparkle Pink Razz Bright Raspberry layered with sugary confectionery notes Pixl Dust Mixed Berries with a sherbet-inspired tang Purple Dream Deep Grape meets mixed Berries Rainbow Rush Fruity confectionery with a fizzy sherbet twist Spearmint A cool, refreshing Spearmint profile Starmix A gummy-inspired blend with a cool Menthol finish Strawberry Burst Bright Strawberry with a juicy, sweet centre Strawberry Kiwi Razz Juicy Strawberry, tangy Kiwi and Sour Raspberry Strawberry Watermelon Classic combination of sweet Strawberry and fresh Watermelon Tropical Wave Coconut, Pineapple, Lime and Guava Please Note: This device does not come with a USB-C Cable Shop Pixl 8000 Refill Pods",
